CHAPTER.VERS:
Hallelujah. Praise

          {+}
         Yahweh from the heavens: Praise him in the heights.

Praise

          {+}
         him, all his angels: Praise

          {+}
         him, all his host.

Praise

          {+}
         him, sun and moon: Praise him, all you

          {+}
         stars of light.

Praise him, you

          {+}
         heavens of heavens, And you

          {+}
         waters that are above the heavens.

Praise Yahweh from the earth, You

          {+}
         sea-monsters, and all deeps.
